            "comprehends": [
             "copies/ty382mw3181#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded high on the figures of the date: every figure is plain. Stamped, not written, and crisp; read along the roll, six figures without separators, as in the documented 311022 pattern. A second, much fainter stamp of about the same length stands beside it and is too broken to read."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       }
